  '1 tsp curry powder': 'Xipunu xitsongo xin\'we xa phawudara ya kheri',
  'Salt and black pepper to taste': 'Munyu na pepere ya ntima hi ku rhandza',
  'Cover the soaked beans with fresh water, bring to a boil, then simmer uncovered for 45-55 minutes until a bean crushes easily between your fingers. Keep a cup of the cooking water.': 'Funengeta tinyawa leti tsakamisiweke hi mati lamantshwa, ti virisa, kutani u ti virisa hi ku olova u nga funengetanga timinete ta 45-55 ku fikela nyawa yi pfotloseka hi ku olova exikarhi ka swikunwana. Hlayisa khapu ya mati yo sweka.',
  'In a second pot, heat the oil over medium heat and cook the onion for 6-8 minutes until soft and golden.': 'Eka mbita ya vumbirhi, hisa mafurha eka ndzilo wa le xikarhi u sweka anyanisi timinete ta 6-8 ku fikela wu olova wu tlhela wu va wa nsuku.',
  'Stir in the garlic and curry powder and cook for 30 seconds, just until fragrant.': 'Hlanganisa galiki na phawudara ya kheri u sweka tisekoni ta 30, ku fikela ku nun\'hwela kahle.',
  'Add the grated tomato and simmer for 8 minutes until it darkens into a thick gravy.': 'Engetela tamatisi leyi kwatiweke u virisa hi ku olova timinete ta 8 ku fikela yi va ya ntima yi va muhluzi wo tiya.',
  'Fold in the drained beans with a splash of the reserved water. Simmer for 10 minutes so the beans take on the gravy, then season and serve over pap or rice.': 'Nghenisa tinyawa leti hunguriweke mati na mati matsongo lawa u ma hlayiseke. Virisa hi ku olova timinete ta 10 leswaku tinyawa ti kuma muhluzi, kutani u nandziharisa u phamela na vuswa kumbe rhayisi.',
  'Brown Lentils': 'Tilentili ta Buraweni',
