  'Fast cooking (no soak)': 'Ti vupfa hi ku hatlisa (a ti tsakamisiwi)',
  'Unlike large beans, brown lentils require no soaking and cook in just 20-25 minutes. Simmer with bay leaf and onion for instant rich savory depth.': 'Ku hambana na tinyawa letikulu, tilentili ta buraweni a ti lavi ku tsakamisiwa naswona ti vupfa hi timinete ta 20-25 ntsena. Virisa hi ku olova na tluka ra bay na anyanisi ku kuma nantswo wo nandziha hi ku hatlisa.',
