  'Rinse the lentils under cold water until the water runs clear. No soaking needed.': 'Hlantswa tilentili ehansi ka mati yo titimela ku fikela mati ma basa. A swi laveki ku tsakamisa.',
  'Heat the oil and cook the onion and carrot for 5 minutes until the onion turns translucent.': 'Hisa mafurha u sweka anyanisi na kherotsi timinete ta 5 ku fikela anyanisi a vonakala.',
  'Add the garlic and bay leaf, stirring for 30 seconds.': 'Engetela galiki na tluka ra bay, u hlanganisa tisekoni ta 30.',
  'Tip in the lentils and water, bring to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer covered for 20-25 minutes until tender but not mushy.': 'Chela tilentili na mati, virisa, kutani u hunguta ndzilo u virisa hi ku olova u funengetile timinete ta 20-25 ku fikela ti olova kambe ti nga pfotloseki.',
  'Remove the bay leaf, season generously, and mash a few spoonfuls against the side of the pot to thicken the broth.': 'Humesa tluka ra bay, nandziharisa kahle, u pfotlosa swipunu swi nga ri swingani etlhelo ka mbita ku tiyisa muhluzi.',
